{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as best friends Chriss and Cross and embark on a cooperative adventure to build an amazing treehouse. <br>Work together to solve puzzles, collect building materials, and explore the imaginative world of Chriss and Cross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who are Chriss and Cross?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chriss and Cross are best friends with the broadest of imaginations. You both embark on an adventure to have a good time before Chriss heads back to school!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/674f768078cd37b7bacd068764bbdec4.poster.avif?t=1769520887\" width=560 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/674f768078cd37b7bacd068764bbdec4.webm?t=1769520887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/674f768078cd37b7bacd068764bbdec4.mp4?t=1769520887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test your wits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your friend cross by stepping on the color buttons, which will magically unveil the matching colored bridge! Explore new lands as you solve these puzzles together and discover exciting adventures along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/0afa43789c7495db1cc3eeab49eaf4cb.poster.avif?t=1769520887\" width=560 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/0afa43789c7495db1cc3eeab49eaf4cb.webm?t=1769520887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/0afa43789c7495db1cc3eeab49eaf4cb.mp4?t=1769520887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A narrative-driven, co-op game where you get to be a kid again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build an amazing tree house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore 40+ levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy the atmospheric environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Have fun with a friend or partner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ... or annoy them by not letting them cross...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1524620?t=1769520887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769520887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/a9a2f100fd182b9081b78d703d8d74e44eabed8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769520887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/a9a2f100fd182b9081b78d703d8d74e44eabed8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769520887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as best friends Chriss and Cross and embark on a cooperative adventure to build an amazing treehouse. <br>Work together to solve puzzles, collect building materials, and explore the imagina